To sound a title (text):
  Set Score's effect to "".
  Set Score's effect priority to 1.
  If the title is "select":
    Set Score's effect to "84:1 96:1".
    Set Score's effect priority to 1.
  If the title is "bump":
    Set Score's effect to "noise:1 42:1".
    Set Score's effect priority to 1.
  If the title is "hit":
    Set Score's effect to "noise:2 45:1 38:2".
    Set Score's effect priority to 2.
  If the title is "heal":
    Set Score's effect to "72:1 76:1 79:1 84:3".
    Set Score's effect priority to 3.
  If the title is "badge":
    Set Score's effect to "72:2 76:2 79:2 84:4 79:2 84:6".
    Set Score's effect priority to 3.
  If the title is "faint":
    Set Score's effect to "67:1 63:1 60:1 55:3".
    Set Score's effect priority to 3.
  If the title is "encounter":
    Set Score's effect to "noise:1 0:1 79:1 84:1 79:1 84:2".
    Set Score's effect priority to 2.
  If the title is "item":
    Set Score's effect to "72:1 76:1 79:1 84:2".
    Set Score's effect priority to 1.
  If the title is "victory":
    Set Score's effect to "72:1 72:1 72:1 72:3 68:3 70:3 72:1 0:1 70:1 72:5".
    Set Score's effect priority to 3.
  Add 1 to Score's effect count.
